  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OCHA: Provision of Child Protection Services for Vulnerable Children Living in the Conflict Affected Districts of Dhi As Sufal and Al Makhadir, Ibb.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will intervene in Dhi As Sufal and Al Makhadir in Ibb governorate. Activities will include: establishment of a community centres, training of social workers in case management, establishment and training of CBCP, legal documentation, cash for protection, case management and parents positive parenting sessions.</narrative>
  </description>
